            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "摩根士丹利公共金融聯席主管Zach Solomon離職加盟道明證券",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"摩根士丹利公共金融聯席主管Zach Solomon離職加盟道明證券\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2a5a0144e1d5bdfee184655035ad1e069dc6b386e10f6eb7b1a438d467732bd1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXNPEAB411K_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">摩根士丹利公共金融聯席主管Zach Solomon離職加盟道明證券</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>Investing.com -</strong> 據彭博社獨家報道，消息人士透露，<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":0,\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\",\"ySubModuleName\":\"anchor_text\"}' data-ylk=\"elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;subsec:anchor_text;\" href=\"https://hk.news.yahoo.com/tag/摩根士丹利\" rel=\"\">摩根士丹利</a>（NYSE:MS）公共金融投資銀行業務聯席主管Zach <a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":0,\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\",\"ySubModuleName\":\"anchor_text\"}' data-ylk=\"elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;subsec:anchor_text;\" href=\"https://hk.news.yahoo.com/tag/Solomon\" rel=\"\">Solomon</a>已離開這家華爾街機構，轉投道明證券（TD Securities）。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">報道指出，Solomon本週已正式離開摩根士丹利。他於週五被聯絡時確認了離職消息，但拒絕進一步置評。摩根士丹利發言人同樣婉拒評論，而道明證券發言人則未有回應彭博社的查詢。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">在摩根士丹利任職期間，Solomon擔任Brightline逾50億美元債券發行的首席銀行家。Brightline是一家私營佛羅里達州客運鐵路公司，負責連接邁阿密與奧蘭多兩地。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-b91f07d9-a9c1-3837-83f6-df8c37255537-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Solomon的離職恰逢道明證券積極擴展其市政債券業務之際。該公司近期持續從摩根大通（NYSE:JPM）及坎托·菲茨傑拉德（Cantor Fitzgerald）招攬銷售人員，並致力拓展其在德克薩斯州的公共金融銀行業務。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">與此同時，Solomon的離職也與Brightline陷入財務困境的時間點相吻合。Brightline於週四申請第11章破產保護，原因是多年來收入持續未能達標，導致公司無力償還為建設佛羅里達鐵路而借入的數十億美元債務。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Brightline的融資結構因其獨特安排而在市政債券市場備受關注。Solomon曾在2024年接受《債券買家》（The Bond Buyer）採訪時，強調「講好Brightline故事」對於推動公司融資的重要性。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">值得注意的是，此次破產申請不涵蓋Brightline的運營公司，因此其客運列車可在重組期間繼續正常運行。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">道明證券此番招攬Solomon，為這家加拿大銀行旗下的業務引入了一位經驗豐富的市政金融銀行家。此舉是道明證券持續擴充市政債券銷售團隊、全面強化美國公共金融業務佈局的重要一步。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E6%91%A9%E6%A0%B9%E5%A3%AB%E4%B8%B9%E5%88%A9%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E9%87%91%E8%9E%8D%E8%81%AF%E5%B8%AD%E4%B8%BB%E7%AE%A1zach-solomon%E9%9B%A2%E8%81%B7%E5%8A%A0%E7%9B%9F%E9%81%93%E6%98%8E%E8%AD%89%E5%88%B8-014333855.html",
